          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"pdbscreen-descriptor-eda-manifest-backed\">PDBscreen Descriptor EDA (Manifest-Backed)</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook reads precomputed chemistry features from:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dataset/pdbscreen_manifest.parquet</code></li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Expected feature columns:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>TPSA / molecular weight / rotatable bonds</li>\n<li>HBD / HBA / Lipinski / Verber</li>\n<li>Ring counts / aromatic ring counts</li>\n<li><code>ligand_smiles</code> (full molecule)</li>\n<li><code>scaffold</code> (Bemis-Murcko core, null for acyclic compounds)</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Leakage-safe defaults:</span>\n<ol>\n<li>Analyze only train split by default.</li>\n<li>Use val/test only for post-hoc reporting (not for feature decisions).</li>\n<li>Quantify scaffold overlap between train and holdout splits.</li>\n</ol></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
